{"version":1,"content":"<p>《GTA6》尚未在全球所有地區正式解鎖，直播熱度已經刷新多項紀錄。遊戲在新西蘭開放後，部分主播利用地區時差及Xbox相關方式提前進入遊戲，三大直播平台的同時觀看人數隨即突破638萬。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587002.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T20:44:25.127271+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T20:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T20:37:35.250847+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T20:37:35.250847+00:00","content_hash":"2172d9ee80a2b61818be1c0a7ac434198a58a4c7a6d522418341027189599827","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}